cDarzi Network Help

GUI:
  Use the network icon in the top panel to connect to Wi-Fi, Ethernet, phone tethering, Bluetooth, or mobile broadband.

Quick checks:
  nmcli device
  rfkill list
  sudo rfkill unblock wifi
  sudo systemctl restart NetworkManager

Range tips:
  Software cannot guarantee a fixed 50 m/100 m Wi-Fi range. Use 2.4 GHz for distance, reduce walls/interference, update firmware, or use Ethernet/USB tethering when reliability matters.
